- **LZ Pro**: convenience admin (coupons, history, option templates, VAT, inventory helpers). Discussed ~€49/mo anchor.
- **Enterprise**: full + hide post-order ads. Discussed ~€99/mo. Public copy sometimes omits Enterprise/ads.
- Ads = platform revenue (play/click/duration pricing — not finalized). Feature flags via FeaturePlan/addons per store.

